#: ../../tools/europepmc_annotations_tools.rst:32
#: cce0e54123144fa0a191e3d7c95b66db
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all annotations of a specific type from multiple "
"articles using the Europe PMC Annotations API. Useful for batch "
"extraction of entities from a set of articles - e.g., extract all "
"chemicals mentioned across a set of related papers, or all organism "
"mentions from a research group's publications. Supports up to 200 article"
" IDs per request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/europepmc_annotations_tools.rst:34
