#: ../../tools/europepmc_annotations_tools.rst:70
#: 498a473a08e8401abd9beb4050bcc413
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get text-mined annotations from a scientific article "
"using the Europe PMC Annotations API. Returns entities extracted from the"
" article text including chemicals, organisms, gene ontology terms, "
"diseases, and gene/protein mentions, with their exact text, surrounding "
"context, ontology URIs, and section locations. Powered by Europe PMC's "
"SciLite text mining pipeline. Use this to extract structured biological "
"entities from published literature without reading the full text. "
"Example: PMC4353746 returns 19 chemical annotations and 12 GO "
"annotations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/europepmc_annotations_tools.rst:74
#: ba432c8b674d4f71918597cf2607e31b
msgid ""
"``article_id`` (string) (required) Article identifier in format "
"'PMC:PMCXXXXXXX' or 'MED:PMID'. Examples: 'PMC:PMC4353746', "
"'PMC:PMC3531190', 'MED:25780448'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/europepmc_annotations_tools.rst:77
#: 38fb1d44cb2048baaaa0ebce183a4c51
msgid ""
"``annotation_type`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by annotation type: "
"'Chemicals', 'Organisms', 'Gene Ontology', 'Diseases', 'Genes & "
"Proteins', 'Accession Numbers'. Default: all types."
msgstr ""

