#: ../../tools/europepmc_annotations_tools.rst:104
#: e17f968888ff479c8130f5064bc3637e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Extract chemical/compound mentions from a scientific "
"article using Europe PMC text mining. Returns chemicals identified in the"
" article with their ChEBI ontology URIs, exact text matches, and "
"surrounding context. Specialized shortcut for the most common annotation "
"use case in drug discovery and pharmacology research. Example: PMC4353746"
" (resistin study) returns 19 chemical annotations including peptide, "
"resistin, and specific compounds."
msgstr ""

